    "## 11. Extended evaluation (identical in all three notebooks)\n",
    "\n",
    "Distances to the closer real cluster, divided by the nha-vs-prn distance. A ratio at or below 1 means the synthetic trace is as close to real traffic as the two real clusters are to each other. FIDELITY is the geometric mean of the ratios."
   ]
